<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - TASOGLOU TRADES EX-DIV.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - TASOGLOU TRADES EX-DIV.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>that shares of electrical appliance wholesaler Tasoglou-DeLonghi</p>
<p>will trade ex-dividend on Thursday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	DIVIDEND/SHARE	   ADJUSTED START PRICE</p>
<p>    Tasoglou	   84.5			  676</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
